@backendAddress = http://localhost:5077

### Process availability
GET {{backendAddress}}/api/health

### List real saved applications
GET {{backendAddress}}/api/applications

### All-time application analytics
GET {{backendAddress}}/api/analytics/applications

### Analytics filtered by inclusive application dates
GET {{backendAddress}}/api/analytics/applications?startDate=2026-10-01&endDate=2026-10-31

### Next 10 future, non-cancelled interview rounds
GET {{backendAddress}}/api/interviews/upcoming

### Interview rounds for an application (replace the identifier as needed)
GET {{backendAddress}}/api/applications/1/interviews

### Validation example: this must return HTTP 400 and creates no record
POST {{backendAddress}}/api/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyName": "",
  "roleTitle": "",
  "applicationDate": "2099-01-01"
}
